---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../site';
---

<Base
  title="Teaching"
  description="Quddusia Azam taught English from 1992, for three decades, from class prep through class 10. She holds a B.Ed. and an M.A."
>
  <h1 class="page-title">Teaching</h1>
  <hr class="rule" />
  <section class="block">
    <h2>The classroom</h2>
    <p>
      For more than thirty years Quddusia Azam taught English to schoolchildren. The heart of that work was classes 3,
      4, and 5: children of about eight to eleven. She is at home with the years up to class 10 as well, students of
      about sixteen. She began in 1992 with a prep class.
    </p>
    <p>
      She has written about those years in <a href="/writing/the-last-two-days">The last two days</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section class="block">
    <h2>Studies</h2>
    <p>She holds a B.Ed. and an M.A.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="block">
    <h2>In public</h2>
    <p>
      In 2020 she appeared in <em>#ThankYouTeachers</em>, a film made for Nihar Shanti Amla by BBH India and directed by
      Niyantha Shekar. It was a portrait of teachers learning to take the classroom online.
    </p>
    <p>
      <a href={site.film} rel="noopener noreferrer">Watch the film</a><br />
      <a href={site.filmCredit} rel="noopener noreferrer">Credits and stills</a>
    </p>
  </section>
  <section class="block">
    <h2>An invitation</h2>
    <p>
      She is glad to be invited to teach. A note can be sent to
      <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>, or through her
      <a href={site.facebook}>Facebook page</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
